\n## Parameters\n\n### atom\n\n`Atom`\\<`TValue`\\>\n\n### options?\n\n[`UseSelectorOptions`](../interfaces/UseSelectorOptions.md)\\<`TValue`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n\\[`TValue`, (`fn`) => `void` & (`value`) => `void`\\]\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst [count, setCount] = useAtom(countAtom)\n```\n"}
